#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/db_api.rst:4
msgid "API documentation for the database interface"
msgstr "API dokumentacija za interfejs baze podataka"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/db_api.rst:9
msgid ""
"This API is thread safe (it uses a multiple reader, single writer locking "
"scheme).  You can access this API like this::"
msgstr "Ovaj API je bezbedan za korišćenje iz više niti (koristi zaključavanje sa više čitalaca i jednim piscem). Pristupa mu se ovako::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/db_api.rst:14
msgid ""
"If you are in a calibre plugin that is part of the main calibre GUI, you get"
" access to it like this instead::"
msgstr "Ako ste u calibre dodatku koji je deo glavnog calibre GUI-ja, pristupate mu ovako umesto toga::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache:1
msgid ""
"An in-memory cache of the metadata.db file from a calibre library. This "
"class also serves as a threadsafe API for accessing the database. The in-"
"memory cache is maintained in normal form for maximum performance."
msgstr "Keš fajla metadata.db iz calibre biblioteke koji se čuva u memoriji. Ova klasa je ujedno API za pristup bazi podataka bezbedan za korišćenje iz više niti. Podaci u kešu održavaju se u normalizovanom obliku radi što boljih performansi."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache:5
msgid ""
"SQLITE is simply used as a way to read and write from metadata.db robustly. "
"All table reading/sorting/searching/caching logic is re-implemented. This "
"was necessary for maximum performance and flexibility."
msgstr "SQLite se koristi samo za pouzdano čitanje iz fajla metadata.db i upisivanje u njega. Logika za čitanje, sortiranje, pretraživanje i keširanje tabela ponovo je implementirana radi što boljih performansi i fleksibilnosti."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/listeners.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.EventType.book_created:1
msgid ""
"When a new book record is created in the database, with the book id as the "
"only argument"
msgstr "Kada se u bazi podataka kreira novi zapis o knjizi, sa ID-jem knjige kao jedinim argumentom"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/listeners.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.EventType.book_edited:1
msgid "When a book format is edited, with arguments: (book_id, fmt)"
msgstr "Kada se format knjige uređuje, sa argumentima: (book_id, fmt)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/listeners.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.EventType.books_removed:1
msgid ""
"When books are removed from the database with the list of book ids as the "
"only argument"
msgstr "Kada se knjige uklone iz baze podataka sa listom ID-jeva knjiga kao jedinim argumentom"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/listeners.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.EventType.format_added:1
msgid "When a format is added to a book, with arguments: (book_id, format)"
msgstr "Kada se format doda knjizi, sa argumentima: (book_id, format)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/listeners.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.EventType.formats_removed:1
msgid ""
"When formats are removed from a book, with arguments: (mapping of book id to"
" set of formats removed from the book)"
msgstr "Kada se formati uklone iz knjige, sa argumentima: (mapiranje ID-ja knjige u skup formata uklonjenih iz knjige)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/listeners.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.EventType.indexing_progress_changed:1
msgid "When the indexing progress changes"
msgstr "Kada se promeni napredak indeksiranja"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/listeners.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.EventType.items_removed:1
msgid ""
"When items such as tags or authors are removed from some books. Arguments: "
"(field_name, affected book ids, ids of removed items)"
msgstr "Kada se stavke kao što su oznake ili autori uklone iz nekih knjiga. Argumenti: (field_name, affected book ids, ids of removed items)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/listeners.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.EventType.items_renamed:1
msgid ""
"When items such as tags or authors are renamed in some or all books. "
"Arguments: (field_name, affected book ids, map of old item id to new item "
"id)"
msgstr "Kada se stavke kao što su oznake ili autori preimenuju u nekim ili svim knjigama. Argumenti: (field_name, affected book ids, map of old item id to new item id)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/listeners.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.EventType.links_changed:1
msgid ""
"When the links associated with items(s) are changed, with arguments: "
"(field_name, item_ids)"
msgstr "Kada se promene veze povezane sa stavkom(ama), sa argumentima: (field_name, item_ids)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/listeners.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.EventType.metadata_changed:1
msgid ""
"When some metadata is changed for some books, with arguments: (name of "
"changed field, set of affected book ids)"
msgstr "Kada se promene neki metapodaci za neke knjige, sa argumentima: (name of changed field, set of affected book ids)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/listeners.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.EventType.notes_changed:1
msgid ""
"When the notes associated with item(s) are changed, with arguments: "
"(field_name, item_ids)"
msgstr "Kada se promene beleške povezane sa stavkom(ama), sa argumentima: (field_name, item_ids)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.add_books:1
msgid ""
"Add the specified books to the library. Books should be an iterable of "
"2-tuples, each 2-tuple of the form :code:`(mi, format_map)` where mi is a "
"Metadata object and format_map is a dictionary of the form :code:`{fmt: "
"path_or_stream}`, for example: :code:`{'EPUB': '/path/to/file.epub'}`."
msgstr "Dodajte navedene knjige u biblioteku. Knjige bi trebalo da budu iterabilne od 2-torki, svaka 2-torka u obliku :code:`(mi, format_map)` gde je mi objekat metapodataka, a format_map rečnik u obliku :code:`{fmt: path_or_stream}`, na primer: :code:`{'EPUB': '/path/to/file.epub'}`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.add_books:6
msgid ""
"Returns a pair of lists: :code:`ids, duplicates`. ``ids`` contains the book "
"ids for all newly created books in the database. ``duplicates`` contains the"
" :code:`(mi, format_map)` for all books that already exist in the database "
"as per the simple duplicate detection heuristic used by :meth:`has_book`."
msgstr "Vraća par lista: :code:`ids, duplicates`. ``ids`` sadrži ID-ove knjiga za sve novokreirane knjige u bazi podataka. ``duplicates`` sadrži :code:`(mi, format_map)` za sve knjige koje već postoje u bazi podataka prema jednostavnoj heuristici za otkrivanje duplikata koju koristi :meth:`has_book`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.add_custom_book_data:1
msgid ""
"Add data for name where val_map is a map of book_ids to values. If "
"delete_first is True, all previously stored data for name will be removed."
msgstr "Dodaje podatke za name; val_map preslikava identifikatore knjiga u vrednosti. Ako je delete_first True, prethodno sačuvani podaci za name biće uklonjeni."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.add_extra_files:1
msgid "Add extra data files"
msgstr "Dodaj dodatne datoteke sa podacima"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.add_format:1
msgid ""
"Add a format to the specified book. Return True if the format was added "
"successfully."
msgstr "Dodaj format navedenoj knjizi. Vraća True ako je format uspešno dodat."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/db_api.rst:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parametri"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.add_format:3
msgid ""
"If True replace existing format, otherwise if the format already exists, "
"return False."
msgstr "Ako je True, zamenjuje postojeći format, inače ako format već postoji, vraća False."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.add_format:4
msgid ""
"If True, file type plugins are run on the format before and after being "
"added."
msgstr "Ako je True, dodaci za tipove datoteka se pokreću na formatu pre i posle dodavanja."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.add_format:5
msgid "Internal use only."
msgstr "Samo za internu upotrebu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.add_listener:1
msgid ""
"Register a callback function that will be called after certain actions are "
"taken on this database. The function must take three arguments: "
"(:class:`EventType`, library_id, event_type_specific_data)"
msgstr "Registruje povratnu funkciju koja će biti pozvana nakon određenih akcija nad ovom bazom podataka. Funkcija mora primiti tri argumenta: (:class:`EventType`, library_id, event_type_specific_data)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.add_notes_resource:1
msgid ""
"Add the specified resource so it can be referenced by notes and return its "
"content hash"
msgstr "Dodaje navedeni resurs kako bi beleške mogle da ga koriste i vraća heš njegovog sadržaja."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.all_annotation_styles:1
msgid "Return a tuple of all built-in annotation styles."
msgstr "Vrati torku svih ugrađenih stilova anotacija."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.all_annotation_types:1
msgid "Return a tuple of all annotation types in the database."
msgstr "Vrati torku svih tipova anotacija u bazi podataka."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.all_annotation_users:1
msgid "Return a tuple of all (user_type, user name) that have annotations."
msgstr "Vrati torku svih (user_type, user name) koji imaju anotacije."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.all_annotations:1
msgid ""
"Return a tuple of all annotations matching the specified criteria. "
"`ignore_removed` controls whether removed (deleted) annotations are also "
"returned. Removed annotations are just a skeleton used for merging of "
"annotations."
msgstr "Vraća torku svih anotacija koje odgovaraju navedenim kriterijumima. `ignore_removed` kontroliše da li se vraćaju i uklonjene (obrisane) anotacije. Uklonjene anotacije su samo kostur koji se koristi za spajanje anotacija."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.all_annotations_for_book:1
msgid ""
"Return a tuple containing all annotations for the specified book_id as a "
"dict with keys: `format`, `user_type`, `user`, `annotation`. Here, "
"annotation is the annotation data."
msgstr "Vraća torku koja sadrži sve anotacije za navedeni book_id kao rečnik sa ključevima: `format`, `user_type`, `user`, `annotation`. Ovde je annotation podatak o anotaciji."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.all_book_ids:1
msgid "Frozen set of all known book ids."
msgstr "Zamrznuti skup svih poznatih ID-ova knjiga."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.all_field_for:1
msgid "Same as field_for, except that it operates on multiple books at once"
msgstr "Isto kao field_for, osim što radi na više knjiga odjednom"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.all_field_ids:1
msgid "Frozen set of ids for all values in the field ``name``."
msgstr "Zamrznuti skup ID-ova za sve vrednosti u polju ``name``."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.all_field_names:1
msgid ""
"Frozen set of all fields names (should only be used for many-one and many-"
"many fields)"
msgstr "Zamrznuti skup svih imena polja (treba koristiti samo za many-one i many-many polja)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.annotation_count_for_book:1
msgid ""
"Return the number of annotations for the specified book available in the "
"database."
msgstr "Vraća broj anotacija za navedenu knjigu dostupnih u bazi podataka."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.annotations_map_for_book:1
msgid ""
"Return a map of annotation type -> annotation data for the specified "
"book_id, format, user and user_type."
msgstr "Vraća mapu tip anotacije -> podaci o anotaciji za navedeni book_id, format, user i user_type."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.author_data:1
msgid "Return author data as a dictionary with keys: name, sort, link"
msgstr "Vraća podatke o autoru kao rečnik sa ključevima: name, sort, link"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.author_data:3
#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.author_sorts:3
msgid ""
"If no authors with the specified ids are found an empty dictionary is "
"returned. If author_ids is None, data for all authors is returned."
msgstr "Ako se ne pronađu autori sa navedenim ID-ovima, vraća se prazan rečnik. Ako je author_ids None, vraćaju se podaci za sve autore."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.author_sort_from_authors:1
msgid ""
"Given a list of authors, return the author_sort string for the authors, "
"preferring the author sort associated with the author over the computed "
"string."
msgstr "Za zadatu listu autora vraća niz author_sort, pri čemu prednost ima redosled sortiranja povezan s autorom, a ne izračunati niz."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.author_sorts:1
msgid "Return author sorts for specified authors."
msgstr "Vraća sortiranja autora za navedene autore."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.book_storage_for_book:1
msgid ""
"Return the per book storage (used for localStorage in the viewers) for the "
"specified book_id, format, user_type and user or None if no storage exists. "
"The storage is a dict of the form: {'timestamp': seconds since epoch, "
"'data': {key: value}}."
msgstr "Vraća skladište podataka za pojedinačnu knjigu (koje čitači koriste za localStorage) za navedene book_id, format, user_type i user, ili None ako skladište ne postoji. Skladište je rečnik oblika: {'timestamp': broj sekundi od epohe, 'data': {ključ: vrednost}}."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.books_for_field:1
msgid ""
"Return all the books associated with the item identified by ``item_id``, "
"where the item belongs to the field ``name``."
msgstr "Vraća sve knjige povezane sa stavkom identifikovanom sa ``item_id``, gde stavka pripada polju ``name``."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.books_for_field:4
msgid ""
"Returned value is a set of book ids, or the empty set if the item or the "
"field does not exist."
msgstr "Vraćena vrednost je skup ID-ova knjiga, ili prazan skup ako stavka ili polje ne postoje."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.books_in_virtual_library:1
msgid "Return the set of books in the specified virtual library"
msgstr "Vraća skup knjiga u navedenoj virtuelnoj biblioteci"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.compress_covers:1
msgid ""
"Compress the cover images for the specified books. A compression quality of "
"100 will perform lossless compression, otherwise lossy compression."
msgstr "Komprimuje slike korica navedenih knjiga. Kvalitet 100 označava kompresiju bez gubitaka, a niže vrednosti kompresiju s gubicima."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.compress_covers:4
msgid ""
"The progress callback will be called with the book_id and the old and new "
"sizes for each book that has been processed. If an error occurs, the new "
"size will be a string with the error details."
msgstr "Povratni poziv napretka će biti pozvan sa book_id i starim i novim veličinama za svaku knjigu koja je obrađena. Ako dođe do greške, nova veličina će biti string sa detaljima greške."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.copy_cover_to:1
msgid ""
"Copy the cover to the file like object ``dest``. Returns False if no cover "
"exists or dest is the same file as the current cover. dest can also be a "
"path in which case the cover is copied to it if and only if the path is "
"different from the current path (taking case sensitivity into account)."
msgstr "Kopira koricu u objekat sličan fajlu ``dest``. Vraća False ako korica ne postoji ili je dest isti fajl kao trenutna korica. dest takođe može biti putanja, u kom slučaju se korica kopira na nju ako i samo ako je putanja različita od trenutne putanje (uzimajući u obzir osetljivost na velika i mala slova)."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.copy_format_to:1
msgid ""
"Copy the format ``fmt`` to the file like object ``dest``. If the specified "
"format does not exist, raises :class:`NoSuchFormat` error. dest can also be "
"a path (to a file), in which case the format is copied to it, iff the path "
"is different from the current path (taking case sensitivity into account)."
msgstr "Kopira format ``fmt`` u objekat sličan fajlu ``dest``. Ako navedeni format ne postoji, podiže :class:`NoSuchFormat` grešku. dest takođe može biti putanja (do fajla), u kom slučaju se format kopira na nju, ako i samo ako je putanja različita od trenutne putanje (uzimajući u obzir osetljivost na velika i mala slova)."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.cover:1
msgid ""
"Return the cover image or None. By default, returns the cover as a "
"bytestring."
msgstr "Vraća sliku korice ili None. Podrazumevano, vraća koricu kao bytestring."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.cover:4
msgid ""
"WARNING: Using as_path will copy the cover to a temp file and return the "
"path to the temp file. You should delete the temp file when you are done "
"with it."
msgstr "UPOZORENJE: as_path kopira koricu u privremeni fajl i vraća putanju do njega. Obrišite taj fajl kada završite s njim."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.cover:8
msgid ""
"If True return the image as an open file object (a SpooledTemporaryFile)"
msgstr "Ako je True, vraća sliku kao otvoreni objekat fajla (SpooledTemporaryFile)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.cover:9
msgid "If True return the image as a QImage object"
msgstr "Ako je True, vraća sliku kao QImage objekat"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.cover:10
msgid "If True return the image as a QPixmap object"
msgstr "Ako je True, vraća sliku kao QPixmap objekat"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.cover:11
msgid "If True return the image as a path pointing to a temporary file"
msgstr "Ako je True, vraća sliku kao putanju koja pokazuje na privremeni fajl"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.data_for_find_identical_books:1
msgid ""
"Return data that can be used to implement :meth:`find_identical_books` in a "
"worker process without access to the db. See db.utils for an implementation."
msgstr "Vraća podatke koji se mogu koristiti za implementaciju :meth:`find_identical_books` u radnom procesu bez pristupa bazi podataka. Pogledajte db.utils za implementaciju."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.data_for_has_book:1
msgid ""
"Return data suitable for use in :meth:`has_book`. This can be used for an "
"implementation of :meth:`has_book` in a worker process without access to the"
" db."
msgstr "Vraća podatke pogodne za upotrebu u :meth:`has_book`. Ovo se može koristiti za implementaciju :meth:`has_book` u radnom procesu bez pristupa bazi podataka."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.delete_annotations:1
msgid "Delete annotations with the specified ids."
msgstr "Obriši anotacije sa navedenim id-jevima."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.delete_custom_book_data:1
msgid ""
"Delete data for name. By default deletes all data, if you only want to "
"delete data for some book ids, pass in a list of book ids."
msgstr "Obriši podatke za name. Podrazumevano briše sve podatke, ako želite da obrišete podatke samo za neke id-jeve knjiga, prosledite listu id-jeva knjiga."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.delete_trash_entry:1
msgid ""
"Delete an entry from the trash. Here category is 'b' for books and 'f' for "
"formats."
msgstr "Obriši unos iz smeća. Ovde je category 'b' za knjige i 'f' za formate."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.embed_metadata:1
msgid ""
"Update metadata in all formats of the specified book_ids to current metadata"
" in the database."
msgstr "Ažuriraj metapodatke u svim formatima navedenih book_ids na trenutne metapodatke u bazi podataka."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.expire_old_trash:1
msgid "Expire entries from the trash that are too old"
msgstr "Uklanja prestare stavke iz korpe za otpatke."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.export_note:1
msgid ""
"Export the note as a single HTML document with embedded images as data: URLs"
msgstr "Izvozi belešku kao jedan HTML dokument sa slikama ugrađenim putem data: URL-ova."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.fast_field_for:1
msgid ""
"Same as field_for, except that it avoids the extra lookup to get the field "
"object"
msgstr "Isto kao field_for, osim što izbegava dodatnu pretragu za dobijanje objekta polja"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.field_for:1
msgid ""
"Return the value of the field ``name`` for the book identified by "
"``book_id``. If no such book exists or it has no defined value for the field"
" ``name`` or no such field exists, then ``default_value`` is returned."
msgstr "Vrati vrednost polja ``name`` za knjigu identifikovanu sa ``book_id``. Ako takva knjiga ne postoji ili nema definisanu vrednost za polje ``name`` ili takvo polje ne postoji, onda se vraća ``default_value``."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.field_for:6
msgid ""
"``default_value`` is not used for title, title_sort, authors, author_sort "
"and series_index. This is because these always have values in the db. "
"``default_value`` is used for all custom columns."
msgstr "``default_value`` se ne koristi za title, title_sort, authors, author_sort i series_index. To je zato što oni uvek imaju vrednosti u bazi. ``default_value`` se koristi za sve prilagođene kolone."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.field_for:10
msgid ""
"The returned value for is_multiple fields are always tuples, even when no "
"values are found (in other words, default_value is ignored). The exception "
"is identifiers for which the returned value is always a dictionary. The "
"returned tuples are always in link order, that is, the order in which they "
"were created."
msgstr "Vraćena vrednost za is_multiple polja su uvek torke, čak i kada se ne pronađu vrednosti (drugim rečima, default_value se ignoriše). Izuzetak su identifikatori za koje je vraćena vrednost uvek rečnik. Vraćene torke su uvek u redosledu veza, odnosno u redosledu u kojem su kreirane."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.field_ids_for:1
msgid ""
"Return the ids (as a tuple) for the values that the field ``name`` has on "
"the book identified by ``book_id``. If there are no values, or no such book,"
" or no such field, an empty tuple is returned."
msgstr "Vrati id-ove (kao torku) za vrednosti koje polje ``name`` ima na knjizi identifikovanoj sa ``book_id``. Ako nema vrednosti, ili nema takve knjige, ili nema takvog polja, vraća se prazna torka."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.field_supports_notes:1
msgid ""
"Return True iff the specified field supports notes. If field is None return "
"frozenset of all fields that support notes."
msgstr "Vrati True ako i samo ako navedeno polje podržava beleške. Ako je polje None vrati frozenset svih polja koja podržavaju beleške."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.find_identical_books:1
msgid ""
"Finds books that have a superset of the authors in mi and the same title "
"(title is fuzzy matched). See also :meth:`data_for_find_identical_books`."
msgstr "Pronalazi knjige čiji skup autora sadrži sve autore iz mi i čiji se naslov približno podudara. Pogledajte i :meth:`data_for_find_identical_books`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.format:1
msgid ""
"Return the e-book format as a bytestring or `None` if the format doesn't "
"exist, or we don't have permission to write to the e-book file."
msgstr "Vraća format e-knjige kao bytestring ili `None` ako format ne postoji, ili nemamo dozvolu za pisanje u datoteku e-knjige."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.format:4
msgid ""
"If True the e-book format is returned as a file object. Note that the file "
"object is a SpooledTemporaryFile, so if what you want to do is copy the "
"format to another file, use :meth:`copy_format_to` instead for performance."
msgstr "Ako je True, format e-knjige se vraća kao objekt datoteke. Imajte na umu da je objekt datoteke SpooledTemporaryFile, pa ako želite kopirati format u drugu datoteku, koristite :meth:`copy_format_to` umesto toga radi boljih performansi."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.format:8
msgid ""
"Copies the format file to a temp file and returns the path to the temp file"
msgstr "Kopira datoteku formata u privremenu datoteku i vraća putanju do privremene datoteke"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.format:10
msgid ""
"If True and returning a path the filename is the same as that used in the "
"library. Note that using this means that repeated calls yield the same temp "
"file (which is re-created each time)"
msgstr "Ako je True i vraća putanju, ime datoteke je isto kao ono koje se koristi u biblioteci. Imajte na umu da korišćenje ovoga znači da ponovljeni pozivi daju istu privremenu datoteku (koja se svaki put ponovo kreira)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.format_abspath:1
msgid ""
"Return absolute path to the e-book file of format `format`. You should "
"almost never use this, as it breaks the threadsafe promise of this API. "
"Instead use, :meth:`copy_format_to`."
msgstr "Vraća apsolutnu putanju do fajla e-knjige formata `format`. Gotovo nikada ne treba da koristite ovu metodu jer zaobilazi zaštitu pri radu iz više niti koju ovaj API pruža. Umesto nje koristite :meth:`copy_format_to`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.format_abspath:5
msgid ""
"Currently used only in calibredb list, the viewer, edit book, compare_format"
" to original format, open with, bulk metadata edit and the catalogs (via "
"get_data_as_dict())."
msgstr "Trenutno se koristi samo u calibredb list, pregledaču, uređivanju knjige, compare_format sa originalnim formatom, otvori sa, masovnom uređivanju metapodataka i katalozima (preko get_data_as_dict())."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.format_abspath:9
msgid ""
"Apart from the viewer, open with and edit book, I don't believe any of the "
"others do any file write I/O with the results of this call."
msgstr "Osim pregledača, otvori sa i uređivanja knjige, ne verujem da bilo koji od ostalih vrši bilo kakav I/O upis u datoteku sa rezultatima ovog poziva."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.format_hash:1
msgid ""
"Return the hash of the specified format for the specified book. The kind of "
"hash is backend dependent, but is usually SHA-256."
msgstr "Vraća heš navedenog formata za navedenu knjigu. Vrsta heša zavisi od pozadinskog sistema, ali je obično SHA-256."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.format_metadata:1
msgid ""
"Return the path, size and mtime for the specified format for the specified "
"book. You should not use path unless you absolutely have to, since accessing"
" it directly breaks the threadsafe guarantees of this API. Instead use the "
":meth:`copy_format_to` method."
msgstr "Vraća putanju, veličinu i mtime za navedeni format za navedenu knjigu. Ne bi trebalo da koristite putanju osim ako apsolutno morate, jer direktan pristup krši garancije o bezbednosti niti ovog API-ja. Umesto toga koristite metodu :meth:`copy_format_to`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.format_metadata:6
msgid ""
"If ``True`` cached values are used, otherwise a slow filesystem access is "
"done. The cache values could be out of date if access was performed to the "
"filesystem outside of this API."
msgstr "Ako je ``True`` koriste se keširane vrednosti, inače se vrši spor pristup sistemu datoteka. Keširane vrednosti mogu biti zastarele ako je pristup sistemu datoteka izvršen van ovog API-ja."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.format_metadata:10
msgid ""
"If ``True`` The max_size field of the database is updated for this book."
msgstr "Ako je ``True``, polje max_size u bazi podataka se ažurira za ovu knjigu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.formats:1
msgid ""
"Return tuple of all formats for the specified book. If verify_formats is "
"True, verifies that the files exist on disk."
msgstr "Vraća torku svih formata za navedenu knjigu. Ako je verify_formats True, proverava da li fajlovi postoje na disku."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_all_items_that_have_notes:1
msgid ""
"Return all item_ids for items that have notes in the specified field or all "
"fields if field_name is None"
msgstr "Vraća sve item_ids za stavke koje imaju beleške u navedenom polju ili svim poljima ako je field_name None"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_all_link_maps_for_book:1
msgid ""
"Returns all links for all fields referenced by book identified by book_id. "
"If book_id doesn't exist then the method returns {}."
msgstr "Vraća sve linkove za sva polja na koja se poziva knjiga identifikovana sa book_id. Ako book_id ne postoji, metoda vraća {}."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_all_link_maps_for_book:4
msgid ""
"Example: Assume author A has link X, author B has link Y, tag S has link F, "
"and tag T has link G. If book 1 has author A and tag T, this method returns "
"{'authors':{'A':'X'}, 'tags':{'T', 'G'}}. If book 2's author is neither A "
"nor B and has no tags, this method returns {}."
msgstr "Primer: Pretpostavimo da autor A ima link X, autor B ima link Y, oznaka S ima link F, a oznaka T ima link G. Ako knjiga 1 ima autora A i oznaku T, ova metoda vraća {'authors':{'A':'X'}, 'tags':{'T', 'G'}}. Ako autor knjige 2 nije ni A ni B i nema oznake, ova metoda vraća {}."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_all_link_maps_for_book:9
msgid "the book id in question."
msgstr "id knjige o kojoj je reč."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/db_api.rst:0
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "Vraća"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_all_link_maps_for_book:11
msgid ""
"{field: {field_value, link_value}, ...  for all fields with a field_value "
"having a non-empty link value for that book"
msgstr "{field: {field_value, link_value}, ...  za sva polja sa field_value koja imaju nepraznu vrednost linka za tu knjigu"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_book_path:1
msgid ""
"Return the relative book path for the given id. Prefer this because you can "
"choose the directory separator, default use the OS one. If unsafe is True, "
"allow to return None if the book_id is not in the library."
msgstr "Vraća relativnu putanju knjige za dati ID. Koristite ovu metodu jer možete izabrati separator direktorijuma; podrazumevano se koristi separator operativnog sistema. Ako je unsafe True, metoda može vratiti None kada book_id nije u biblioteci."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_categories:1
msgid "Used internally to implement the Tag Browser"
msgstr "Koristi se interno za implementaciju Pregledača oznaka"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_custom_book_data:1
msgid ""
"Get data for name. By default returns data for all book_ids, pass in a list "
"of book ids if you only want some data. Returns a map of book_id to values. "
"If a particular value could not be decoded, uses default for it."
msgstr "Dobavi podatke za name. Podrazumevano vraća podatke za sve book_ids, prosledite listu ID-jeva knjiga ako želite samo neke podatke. Vraća mapu book_id u vrednosti. Ako određena vrednost nije mogla biti dekodirana, koristi default za nju."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_id_map:1
msgid ""
"Return a mapping of id numbers to values for the specified field. The field "
"must be a many-one or many-many field, otherwise a ValueError is raised."
msgstr "Vrati mapiranje ID brojeva u vrednosti za navedeno polje. Polje mora biti many-one ili many-many polje, inače se podiže ValueError."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_ids_for_custom_book_data:1
msgid "Return the set of book ids for which name has data."
msgstr "Vrati skup ID-jeva knjiga za koje name ima podatke."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_item_id:1
msgid ""
"Return the item id for item_name or None if not found. This function is very"
" slow if doing lookups for multiple names use either get_item_ids() or "
"get_item_name_map(). Similarly, case sensitive lookups are faster than case "
"insensitive ones."
msgstr "Vrati ID stavke za item_name ili None ako nije pronađeno. Ova funkcija je veoma spora ako se vrše pretrage za više imena, koristite ili get_item_ids() ili get_item_name_map(). Slično tome, pretrage osetljive na velika i mala slova su brže od onih koje nisu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_item_ids:1
msgid "Return a dict mapping item_name to the item id or None"
msgstr "Vrati rečnik koji mapira item_name u ID stavke ili None"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_item_name:1
msgid ""
"Return the item name for the item specified by item_id in the specified "
"field. See also :meth:`get_id_map`."
msgstr "Vrati ime stavke za stavku navedenu pomoću item_id u navedenom polju. Pogledajte takođe :meth:`get_id_map`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_item_name_map:1
msgid "Return mapping of item values to ids"
msgstr "Vrati mapiranje vrednosti stavki u ID-jeve"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_link_map:1
msgid "Return a dictionary of links for the supplied field."
msgstr "Vrati rečnik linkova za prosleđeno polje."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_link_map:3
msgid "the lookup name of the field for which the link map is desired"
msgstr "ime za pretragu polja za koje se želi mapa linkova"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_link_map:5
msgid "{field_value:link_value, ...} for non-empty links"
msgstr "{field_value:link_value, ...} za linkove koji nisu prazni"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_metadata:1
msgid ""
"Return metadata for the book identified by book_id as a "
":class:`calibre.ebooks.metadata.book.base.Metadata` object. Note that the "
"list of formats is not verified. If get_cover is True, the cover is "
"returned, either a path to temp file as mi.cover or if cover_as_data is True"
" then as mi.cover_data."
msgstr "Vraća metapodatke za knjigu identifikovanu sa book_id kao :class:`calibre.ebooks.metadata.book.base.Metadata` objekat. Imajte na umu da lista formata nije verifikovana. Ako je get_cover True, vraća se korica, bilo kao putanja do privremenog fajla kao mi.cover ili ako je cover_as_data True onda kao mi.cover_data."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_next_series_num_for:1
msgid ""
"Return the next series index for the specified series, taking into account "
"the various preferences that control next series number generation."
msgstr "Vraća sledeći indeks serije za navedenu seriju, uzimajući u obzir različite postavke koje kontrolišu generisanje sledećeg broja serije."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_next_series_num_for:4
msgid "The series-like field (defaults to the builtin series column)"
msgstr "Polje slično seriji (podrazumevano je ugrađena kolona serije)"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_next_series_num_for:5
msgid ""
"If True, returns a mapping of book_id to current series_index value instead."
msgstr "Ako je True, umesto toga vraća mapiranje book_id u trenutnu vrednost series_index."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_notes_resource:1
msgid ""
"Return a dict containing the resource data and name or None if no resource "
"with the specified hash is found"
msgstr "Vraća rečnik koji sadrži podatke o resursu i ime ili None ako nije pronađen resurs sa navedenim hešom"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_pages:1
msgid "Return page count information for the specified book"
msgstr "Vraća informacije o broju stranica za navedenu knjigu"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_proxy_metadata:1
msgid ""
"Like :meth:`get_metadata` except that it returns a ProxyMetadata object that"
" only reads values from the database on demand. This is much faster than "
"get_metadata when only a small number of fields need to be accessed from the"
" returned metadata object."
msgstr "Kao :meth:`get_metadata` osim što vraća ProxyMetadata objekat koji čita vrednosti iz baze podataka samo na zahtev. Ovo je mnogo brže od get_metadata kada je potrebno pristupiti samo malom broju polja iz vraćenog objekta metapodataka."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.get_usage_count_by_id:1
msgid ""
"Return a mapping of id to usage count for all values of the specified field,"
" which must be a many-one or many-many field."
msgstr "Vraća mapiranje id-a u broj korišćenja za sve vrednosti navedenog polja, koje mora biti polje više-prema-jedan ili više-prema-više."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.has_book:1
msgid ""
"Return True iff the database contains an entry with the same title as the "
"passed in Metadata object. The comparison is case-insensitive. See also "
":meth:`data_for_has_book`."
msgstr "Vraća True ako i samo ako baza podataka sadrži unos sa istim naslovom kao prosleđeni Metadata objekat. Poređenje ne razlikuje velika i mala slova. Pogledajte takođe :meth:`data_for_has_book`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.has_format:1
msgid "Return True iff the format exists on disk"
msgstr "Vraća True ako i samo ako format postoji na disku"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.has_id:1
msgid "Return True iff the specified book_id exists in the db"
msgstr "Vraća True ako i samo ako navedeni book_id postoji u bazi podataka"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.import_note:1
msgid ""
"Import a previously exported note or an arbitrary HTML file as the note for "
"the specified item"
msgstr "Uvezi prethodno izvezenu belešku ili proizvoljnu HTML datoteku kao belešku za navedenu stavku"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.init:1
msgid "Initialize this cache with data from the backend."
msgstr "Inicijalizuje ovaj keš podacima iz pozadinskog sistema."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.items_with_notes_in_book:1
msgid ""
"Return a dict of field to items that have associated notes for that field "
"for the specified book"
msgstr "Vraća rečnik polja u stavke koje imaju pridružene beleške za to polje za navedenu knjigu"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.link_for:1
msgid ""
"Return the link, if any, for the specified item or None if no link is found"
msgstr "Vraća vezu, ako postoji, za navedenu stavku ili None ako veza nije pronađena"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.list_extra_files:1
msgid "Get information about extra files in the book's directory."
msgstr "Dobij informacije o dodatnim datotekama u direktorijumu knjige."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.list_extra_files:3
msgid "the database book id for the book"
msgstr "id knjige u bazi podataka za knjigu"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.list_extra_files:4
msgid ""
"the pattern of filenames to search for. Empty pattern matches all extra "
"files. Patterns must use / as separator. Use the DATA_FILE_PATTERN constant "
"to match files inside the data directory."
msgstr "obrazac imena datoteka za pretragu. Prazan obrazac se podudara sa svim dodatnim datotekama. Obrasci moraju koristiti / kao separator. Koristite konstantu DATA_FILE_PATTERN za podudaranje datoteka unutar direktorijuma podataka."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.list_extra_files:7
msgid ""
"A tuple of all extra files matching the specified pattern. Each element of "
"the tuple is ExtraFile(relpath, file_path, stat_result). Where relpath is "
"the relative path of the file to the book directory using / as a separator. "
"stat_result is the result of calling os.stat() on the file."
msgstr "Torka svih dodatnih datoteka koje se podudaraju sa navedenim obrascem. Svaki element torke je ExtraFile(relpath, file_path, stat_result). Gde je relpath relativna putanja datoteke do direktorijuma knjige koristeći / kao separator. stat_result je rezultat pozivanja os.stat() na datoteci."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.mark_for_pages_recount:1
msgid "Mark all books for recount of pages"
msgstr "Označi sve knjige za ponovno brojanje stranica"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.merge_annotations_for_book:1
msgid ""
"Merge the specified annotations into the existing annotations for book_id, "
"fm, user_type, and user."
msgstr "Spoji navedene anotacije u postojeće anotacije za book_id, fm, user_type i user."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.merge_extra_files:1
msgid ""
"Merge the extra files from src_ids into dest_id. Conflicting files are auto-"
"renamed unless replace=True in which case they are replaced."
msgstr "Spoji dodatne fajlove iz src_ids u dest_id. Fajlovi u konfliktu se automatski preimenuju osim ako je replace=True, u kom slučaju se zamenjuju."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.move_book_from_trash:1
msgid "Undelete a book from the trash directory"
msgstr "Vraća obrisanu knjigu iz korpe za otpatke."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.move_format_from_trash:1
msgid "Undelete a format from the trash directory"
msgstr "Vraća obrisani format iz korpe za otpatke."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.multisort:1
msgid ""
"Return a list of sorted book ids. If ids_to_sort is None, all book ids are "
"returned."
msgstr "Vrati listu sortiranih ID-jeva knjiga. Ako je ids_to_sort None, vraćaju se svi ID-jevi knjiga."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.multisort:4
msgid ""
"fields must be a list of 2-tuples of the form (field_name, ascending=True or"
" False). The most significant field is the first 2-tuple."
msgstr "fields mora biti lista 2-torki u obliku (field_name, ascending=True ili False). Najznačajnije polje je prva 2-torka."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.notes_data_for:1
msgid "Return all notes data as a dict or None if note does not exist"
msgstr "Vrati sve podatke o beleškama kao rečnik ili None ako beleška ne postoji"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.notes_for:1
msgid "Return the notes document or an empty string if not found"
msgstr "Vrati dokument beleške ili prazan string ako nije pronađen"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.notes_resources_used_by:1
msgid ""
"Return the set of resource hashes of all resources used by the note for the "
"specified item"
msgstr "Vrati skup heševa resursa svih resursa koje koristi beleška za navedenu stavku"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.pages_needs_scan:1
msgid ""
"Return the subset of books (or all books if empty) that are marked as "
"needing a scan to update page count"
msgstr "Vrati podskup knjiga (ili sve knjige ako je prazno) koje su označene kao da im je potrebno skeniranje za ažuriranje broja stranica"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.pref:1
msgid ""
"Return the value for the specified preference or the value specified as "
"``default`` if the preference is not set."
msgstr "Vrati vrednost za navedenu postavku ili vrednost navedenu kao ``default`` ako postavka nije postavljena."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.queue_pages_scan:1
msgid ""
"Start a scan updating page counts for all books that need a scan. If book_id"
" is specified, then only that book is scanned and it is always scanned. When"
" `force` is True, the existing pages value, if any, is discarded so that the"
" book is forcibly rescanned even if the existing value was up-to-date."
msgstr "Započni skeniranje ažurirajući broj stranica za sve knjige kojima je potrebno skeniranje. Ako je book_id naveden, onda se samo ta knjiga skenira i uvek se skenira. Kada je `force` True, postojeća vrednost stranica, ako postoji, se odbacuje tako da se knjiga prisilno ponovo skenira čak i ako je postojeća vrednost bila ažurna."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.read_backup:1
msgid ""
"Return the OPF metadata backup for the book as a bytestring or None if no "
"such backup exists."
msgstr "Vrati OPF rezervnu kopiju metapodataka za knjigu kao bytestring ili None ako takva rezervna kopija ne postoji."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.refresh_format_sizes:1
msgid ""
"Update the database with the on-disk sizes of the specified format files. "
"``size_map`` maps ``(book_id, fmt)`` to the size of the format file. Used to"
" fix stored sizes that have gone stale because format files were changed "
"outside of calibre. Returns the ids of the books whose stored sizes were "
"changed."
msgstr "Ažuriraj bazu podataka sa veličinama na disku navedenih datoteka formata. ``size_map`` mapira ``(book_id, fmt)`` na veličinu datoteke formata. Koristi se za popravljanje sačuvanih veličina koje su zastarele jer su datoteke formata promenjene van calibre-a. Vraća id-ove knjiga čije su sačuvane veličine promenjene."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.remove_books:1
msgid ""
"Remove the books specified by the book_ids from the database and delete "
"their format files. If ``permanent`` is False, then the format files are "
"placed in the per-library trash directory."
msgstr "Uklanja knjige navedene u book_ids iz baze podataka i briše njihove fajlove s formatima. Ako je ``permanent`` False, fajlovi se premeštaju u korpu za otpatke te biblioteke."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.remove_extra_files:1
msgid ""
"Delete the specified extra files, either to Recycle Bin or permanently."
msgstr "Izbriši navedene dodatne datoteke, bilo u korpu za otpatke ili trajno."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.remove_formats:1
msgid "Remove the specified formats from the specified books."
msgstr "Ukloni navedene formate iz navedenih knjiga."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.remove_formats:3
msgid "A mapping of book_id to a list of formats to be removed from the book."
msgstr "Mapiranje book_id na listu formata koji treba da se uklone iz knjige."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.remove_formats:4
msgid ""
"If True, only remove the record for the format from the db, do not delete "
"the actual format file from the filesystem."
msgstr "Ako je True, samo ukloni zapis za format iz baze podataka, ne briši stvarnu datoteku formata iz sistema datoteka."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.remove_formats:5
msgid ""
"A map of book id to set of formats actually deleted from the filesystem for "
"that book"
msgstr "Mapa id-a knjige na skup formata koji su stvarno izbrisani iz sistema datoteka za tu knjigu"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.remove_items:1
msgid ""
"Delete all items in the specified field with the specified ids. Returns the "
"set of affected book ids. ``restrict_to_book_ids`` is an optional set of "
"books ids. If specified the items will only be removed from those books."
msgstr "Obriši sve stavke u navedenom polju sa navedenim id-ovima. Vraća skup id-ova pogođenih knjiga. ``restrict_to_book_ids`` je opcioni skup id-ova knjiga. Ako je naveden, stavke će biti uklonjene samo iz tih knjiga."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.rename_extra_files:1
msgid "Rename extra data files"
msgstr "Preimenuj dodatne datoteke sa podacima"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.rename_items:1
msgid ""
"Rename items from a many-one or many-many field such as tags or series."
msgstr "Preimenuj stavke iz polja više-na-jedan ili više-na-više kao što su oznake ili serije."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.rename_items:3
msgid ""
"When renaming in a series-like field also change the series_index values."
msgstr "Prilikom preimenovanja u polju sličnom seriji takođe promeni vrednosti series_index."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.rename_items:4
msgid ""
"An optional set of book ids for which the rename is to be performed, "
"defaults to all books."
msgstr "Opcioni skup id-ova knjiga za koje se vrši preimenovanje, podrazumevano za sve knjige."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.restore_book:1
msgid ""
"Restore the book entry in the database for a book that already exists on the"
" filesystem"
msgstr "Vrati unos knjige u bazu podataka za knjigu koja već postoji u sistemu datoteka"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.restore_original_format:1
msgid ""
"Restore the specified format from the previously saved ORIGINAL_FORMAT, if "
"any. Return True on success. The ORIGINAL_FORMAT is deleted after a "
"successful restore."
msgstr "Vrati navedeni format iz prethodno sačuvanog ORIGINAL_FORMAT, ako postoji. Vraća True u slučaju uspeha. ORIGINAL_FORMAT se briše nakon uspešnog vraćanja."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.safe_read_lock:1
msgid ""
"A safe read lock is a lock that does nothing if the thread already has a "
"write lock, otherwise it acquires a read lock. This is necessary to prevent "
"DowngradeLockErrors, which can happen when updating the search cache in the "
"presence of composite columns. Updating the search cache holds an exclusive "
"lock, but searching a composite column involves reading field values via "
"ProxyMetadata which tries to get a shared lock. There may be other scenarios"
" that trigger this as well."
msgstr "Bezbedno zaključavanje za čitanje ne radi ništa ako nit već drži zaključavanje za pisanje; u suprotnom pribavlja zaključavanje za čitanje. Time se sprečava DowngradeLockErrors, do koga može doći pri ažuriranju keša pretrage kada postoje složene kolone. Ažuriranje keša drži ekskluzivno zaključavanje, dok pretraga složene kolone čita vrednosti polja preko ProxyMetadata, koji pokušava da pribavi deljeno zaključavanje. Mogući su i drugi takvi slučajevi."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.safe_read_lock:9
msgid ""
"This property returns a new lock object on every access. This lock object is"
" not recursive (for performance) and must only be used in a with statement "
"as ``with cache.safe_read_lock:`` otherwise bad things will happen."
msgstr "Ovo svojstvo pri svakom pristupu vraća novi objekat za zaključavanje. Taj objekat nije rekurzivan (radi boljih performansi) i sme se koristiti samo u naredbi with, kao ``with cache.safe_read_lock:``; u suprotnom može doći do grešaka."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.save_original_format:1
msgid ""
"Save a copy of the specified format as ORIGINAL_FORMAT, overwriting any "
"existing ORIGINAL_FORMAT."
msgstr "Sačuvaj kopiju navedenog formata kao ORIGINAL_FORMAT, prepisujući bilo koji postojeći ORIGINAL_FORMAT."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.search:1
msgid ""
"Search the database for the specified query, returning a set of matched book"
" ids."
msgstr "Pretraži bazu podataka za navedeni upit, vraćajući skup podudarnih ID-ova knjiga."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.search:3
msgid ""
"A restriction that is ANDed to the specified query. Note that restrictions "
"are cached, therefore the search for a AND b will be slower than a with "
"restriction b."
msgstr "Ograničenje koje se sa zadatim upitom kombinuje operatorom AND. Pošto se ograničenja keširaju, pretraga a AND b biće sporija od pretrage a uz ograničenje b."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.search:6
msgid "Used internally (virtual fields such as on_device to search over)."
msgstr "Koristi se interno (virtuelna polja kao što je on_device za pretragu)."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.search:8
msgid ""
"If not None, a set of book ids for which books will be searched instead of "
"searching all books."
msgstr "Ako nije None, skup ID-ova knjiga za koje će se knjige pretraživati umesto pretraživanja svih knjiga."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.search_annotations:1
msgid ""
"Return of a tuple of annotations matching the specified Full-text query."
msgstr "Vraća torku anotacija koje se podudaraju sa navedenim upitom za pretragu celog teksta."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.search_notes:1
msgid ""
"Search the text of notes using an FTS index. If the query is empty return "
"all notes."
msgstr "Pretraži tekst beleški koristeći FTS indeks. Ako je upit prazan, vrati sve beleške."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.set_annotations_for_book:1
msgid ""
"Set all annotations for the specified book_id, fmt, user_type and user."
msgstr "Postavi sve anotacije za navedeni book_id, fmt, user_type i user."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.set_conversion_options:1
msgid "options must be a map of the form {book_id:conversion_options}"
msgstr "options mora biti mapa u obliku {book_id:conversion_options}"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.set_cover:1
msgid ""
"Set the cover for this book. The data can be either a QImage, QPixmap, file "
"object or bytestring. It can also be None, in which case any existing cover "
"is removed."
msgstr "Postavi korice za ovu knjigu. Podaci mogu biti QImage, QPixmap, objekat datoteke ili bytestring. Takođe može biti None, u kom slučaju se uklanjaju sve postojeće korice."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.set_field:1
msgid ""
"Set the values of the field specified by ``name``. Returns the set of all "
"book ids that were affected by the change."
msgstr "Postavi vrednosti polja navedenog sa ``name``. Vraća skup svih ID-ova knjiga na koje je promena uticala."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.set_field:3
msgid "Mapping of book_ids to values that should be applied."
msgstr "Mapiranje book_ids na vrednosti koje treba primeniti."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.set_field:4
msgid ""
"If True, the case of many-one or many-many fields will be changed. For "
"example, if a  book has the tag ``tag1`` and you set the tag for another "
"book to ``Tag1`` then the both books will have the tag ``Tag1`` if "
"allow_case_change is True, otherwise they will both have the tag ``tag1``."
msgstr "Ako je True, promeniće se upotreba velikih i malih slova u poljima tipa više-prema-jedan ili više-prema-više. Na primer, ako jedna knjiga ima oznaku ``tag1``, a drugoj postavite oznaku ``Tag1``, obe će dobiti oznaku ``Tag1`` kada je allow_case_change True; u suprotnom će obe imati ``tag1``."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.set_field:8
msgid "Used internally, you should never change it."
msgstr "Koristi se interno, nikada ne bi trebalo da ga menjate."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.set_link_map:1
msgid ""
"Sets links for item values in field. Note: this method doesn't change values"
" not in the value_to_link_map"
msgstr "Postavlja veze za vrednosti stavki u polju. Napomena: ovaj metod ne menja vrednosti koje nisu u value_to_link_map"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.set_link_map:4
msgid "the lookup name"
msgstr "ime za pretragu"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.set_link_map:5
msgid ""
"dict(field_value:link, ...). Note that these are values, not field ids."
msgstr "dict(field_value:link, ...). Imajte na umu da su ovo vrednosti, a ne id-ovi polja."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.set_link_map:7
msgid "books changed by setting the link"
msgstr "knjige promenjene postavljanjem veze"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.set_metadata:1
msgid "Set metadata for the book `id` from the `Metadata` object `mi`"
msgstr "Postavi metapodatke za knjigu `id` iz `Metadata` objekta `mi`"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.set_metadata:3
msgid ""
"Setting force_changes=True will force set_metadata to update fields even if "
"mi contains empty values. In this case, 'None' is distinguished from "
"'empty'. If mi.XXX is None, the XXX is not replaced, otherwise it is. The "
"tags, identifiers, and cover attributes are special cases. Tags and "
"identifiers cannot be set to None so they will always be replaced if "
"force_changes is true. You must ensure that mi contains the values you want "
"the book to have. Covers are always changed if a new cover is provided, but "
"are never deleted. Also note that force_changes has no effect on setting "
"title or authors."
msgstr "Postavljanje force_changes=True će primorati set_metadata da ažurira polja čak i ako mi sadrži prazne vrednosti. U ovom slučaju, 'None' se razlikuje od 'prazno'. Ako je mi.XXX None, XXX se ne zamenjuje, inače se zamenjuje. Oznake, identifikatori i atributi korica su posebni slučajevi. Oznake i identifikatori se ne mogu postaviti na None pa će uvek biti zamenjeni ako je force_changes true. Morate osigurati da mi sadrži vrednosti koje želite da knjiga ima. Korice se uvek menjaju ako je obezbeđena nova korica, ali se nikada ne brišu. Takođe imajte na umu da force_changes nema uticaja na postavljanje naslova ili autora."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.set_notes_for:1
msgid ""
"Set the notes document. If the searchable text is different from the "
"document, specify it as searchable_text. If the document references "
"resources their hashes must be present in resource_hashes. Set "
"remove_unused_resources to True to cleanup unused resources, note that "
"updating a note automatically cleans up resources pertaining to that note "
"anyway."
msgstr "Postavite dokument beleški. Ako se tekst za pretragu razlikuje od dokumenta, navedite ga kao searchable_text. Ako dokument referencira resurse, njihovi heševi moraju biti prisutni u resource_hashes. Postavite remove_unused_resources na True da biste očistili neiskorišćene resurse, imajte na umu da ažuriranje beleške automatski čisti resurse koji se odnose na tu belešku u svakom slučaju."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.set_pages:1
msgid "Set page count information for the specified book"
msgstr "Postavi informacije o broju stranica za navedenu knjigu"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.set_pref:1
msgid ""
"Set the specified preference to the specified value. See also :meth:`pref`."
msgstr "Postavi navedenu postavku na navedenu vrednost. Pogledajte takođe :meth:`pref`."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.split_if_is_multiple_composite:1
msgid ""
"If f is a composite column lookup key and the column is is_multiple then "
"split v into unique non-empty values. The comparison is case sensitive. "
"Order is not preserved. Return a list() for compatibility with proxy "
"metadata field getters, for example tags."
msgstr "Ako je f ključ za pretragu složene kolone, a kolona je is_multiple, deli v na jedinstvene neprazne vrednosti. Poređenje razlikuje velika i mala slova. Redosled se ne čuva. Vraća list() radi kompatibilnosti s metodama za čitanje polja posredničkih metapodataka, na primer oznaka."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.tags_older_than:1
msgid ""
"Return the ids of all books having the tag ``tag`` that are older than the "
"specified time. tag comparison is case insensitive."
msgstr "Vrati id-ove svih knjiga koje imaju oznaku ``tag`` a koje su starije od navedenog vremena. Poređenje oznaka nije osetljivo na velika i mala slova."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.tags_older_than:4
msgid ""
"A timedelta object or None. If None, then all ids with the tag are returned."
msgstr "Objekat timedelta ili None. Ako je None, onda se vraćaju svi id-ovi sa tom oznakom."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.tags_older_than:7
msgid ""
"If not None the list of matches will be restricted to books that have this "
"tag"
msgstr "Ako nije None, lista poklapanja će biti ograničena na knjige koje imaju ovu oznaku"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.tags_older_than:10
msgid ""
"A list of authors. If not None the list of matches will be restricted to "
"books that have these authors (case insensitive)."
msgstr "Lista autora. Ako nije None, lista poklapanja će biti ograničena na knjige koje imaju ove autore (neosetljivo na velika i mala slova)."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.unretire_note_for:1
msgid ""
"Unretire a previously retired note for the specified item. Notes are retired"
" when an item is removed from the database"
msgstr "Vrati prethodno povučenu belešku za navedenu stavku. Beleške se povlače kada se stavka ukloni iz baze podataka"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.update_annotations:1
msgid "Update annotations."
msgstr "Ažuriraj anotacije."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.update_book_storage_for_book:1
msgid ""
"Set the per book storage for the specified book_id, format, user_type and "
"user, unless the existing storage is newer than entry. Returns the storage "
"in effect after the update. Clear the storage by passing an entry with empty"
" data."
msgstr "Postavlja skladište podataka za pojedinačnu knjigu za navedene book_id, format, user_type i user, osim ako je postojeće skladište novije od prosleđenog unosa. Vraća skladište koje važi nakon ažuriranja. Za brisanje skladišta prosledite unos sa praznim podacima."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/src/calibre/db/cache.pydocstring of
#: calibre.db.cache.Cache.user_categories_for_books:1
msgid ""
"Return the user categories for the specified books. proxy_metadata_map is "
"optional and is useful for a performance boost, in contexts where a "
"ProxyMetadata object for the books already exists. It should be a mapping of"
" book_ids to their corresponding ProxyMetadata objects."
msgstr "Vrati korisničke kategorije za navedene knjige. proxy_metadata_map je opciono i korisno je za poboljšanje performansi, u kontekstima gde ProxyMetadata objekat za knjige već postoji. Trebalo bi da bude mapiranje book_ids na njihove odgovarajuće ProxyMetadata objekte."
